<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - MEMC Electronic started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley said analyst Dan Myers initiated coverage of MEMC Electronic Materials Inc with an outperform rating.</p>
